      "content_hash": "sha256:d8e87dab9d6f70953ea912fbf76f2c725674dfc62f8c72da292a4cb110b0d211",
      "content": "process-max controls parallel compression and transfer workers. More workers consume resources. Compression type and level change CPU and storage tradeoffs. db-timeout must remain below protocol-timeout. Test changes with the same workload and a restore."
    },
