      "content_hash": "sha256:b648d44534b44bc41973122235ae31108c01ff5160e7af284f1bc4e25f38d620",
      "content": "When database checksums are enabled, pgBackRest normally validates pages during backup. Checksum failures can be warnings rather than a failed exit. Inspect metadata and logs, then verify the restored data."
    },
