      "content_hash": "sha256:ab10c9c4a42c831801c4fa2c2270977e24ea011cee835e10288b9a54af703254",
      "content": "Streaming replication transfers WAL to a standby, which replays it. Asynchronous replication can lag behind commits. Valid but unwanted changes are replayed too. Authentication, WAL availability and receiver/replay progress are separate concerns; promoting a standby does not undo replicated mistakes."
    },
